<title>OMAN: Oman International Bank H1 net up.</title>
<headline>Oman International Bank H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Omani rials)</p>
<p> Net profit			     4.283	vs	3.158</p>
<p> Net interest income		 10.107	vs	9.035</p>
<p> Other operating income	     3.546	vs	3.500</p>
<p> Provisions			     1.227	vs	1.416</p>
<p>Full name: Oman International Bank SAOG.</p>
<p>Note - The figures are unaudited.</p>
</text>
